was_rpm_only.description:
Diagnoser backfilled `duty: None` history entries with derived
 values (channel has no native duty reporting). Clears on delete;
 the UI uses it to decide whether to prompt for a chart reload.

anyOf.description:
Reset the channel to its hardware default. Only `true` is meaningful;
 `false` is treated as a no-op by the engine. This variant is never persisted
 to the TOML config (it is only used as an in-flight command).
